suspicions.fix_diff:
In SpannerPostgreSQLSqlAstTranslator.java and SpannerSqlAstTranslator.java, changed:
    if ( expression instanceof Literal ) {
        appendSql( "'0' || '0'" );
    }
to:
    if ( expression instanceof Literal ) {
        expression.accept( this );
    }

This replaces the hardcoded string concatenation "'0' || '0'" (which always produces '00') with expression.accept(this) which properly renders the actual literal value.

